\**{c=red:Note:}** If you have the quest {q:Class Reunion|Class Reunion|Class Reunion} active, you will not be able to flag this quest until you complete it.
=2 Walkthrough
* Zone in and out if you just completed {q:Star Struck|Star Struck|Star Struck}.
* Speak to {p:Koru-Moru} to begin the quest.
** **(Optional)** Talk to the NPCs outside for some hints. Specifically: {n:Luuh Koplehn}, {n:Bonchacha}, {n:Maan-Pokuun}.
*** Maan-Pokuun suggests talking to {p:Yoran-Oran}, who recites some cryptic poetry about the past and fossils.
*** Luuh suggests asking the fisherman's guild. {n:Mhe Quryobhi} hasn't heard of the shell, and {n:Tokaka} says that {p:Yoran-Oran} used to have one.
*** After getting the hint from Tokaka, Yoran-Oran will now specifically mention the {z:Maze of Shakhrami} as a place to find marine fossils.
* Head to the {z:Maze of Shakhrami}.
* Examine the **Fossil Rock** {z:at (F-8) on Map 2|Maze of Shakhrami}, to spawn the NM {m:Ichorous Ire}. It will drop a {p:Burnite Shell} (**{p:G|Guaranteed (100%)}**).
* Trade the {p:Burnite Shell} to Koru-Moru to complete the quest.
** **(Optional)** Talk to Yoran-Oran again for some concluding dialogue.

